    "detailed_description": "<h1>Wishlist the full game!</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>This is the free version of <strong>Star Farmer: Warlock of the Universe</strong>. As a Warlock, fund your expedition to discover rare and powerful flora through your participation in the lucrative profession of star farming. Build the ultimate space farm as you explore the galaxy and stumble onto the mystery of a dead planet. Cultivate exotic plant life, trade your harvests for credits, and customize your runs with unique powers in this roguelite adventure.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Star Farmer: Prologue Features</h2>Star Farmer: Prologue is a part of the full version of the upcoming game, <strong>Star Farmer: Warlock of the Universe</strong>. It includes:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>2 acts from the full version of the game (from a total of 5)<br></li><li>Over 100 powers to take advantage of on your runs<br></li><li>Cutscenes and story moments covering the early portion of the game<br></li><li>3 unlockable Warlock Powers <br></li><li>Herbarium<br></li><li>6 audio logs to collect<br></li><li>Full farming gameplay for 6 different plant types<br></li><li>A save file that is shared with the full version of the game<br></li><li>Collectable furniture for your ship<br></li><li>An upgradeable character and ship to a fifth of the power of the maximum in the full version of the game</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Harvest the Cosmos</h2>Venture into uncharted territories and gather an array of seeds and rare materials. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563140/extras/89849ddb9d21d514c2afc134c6477e2d.poster.avif?t=1695033701\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563140/extras/89849ddb9d21d514c2afc134c6477e2d.webm?t=1695033701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563140/extras/89849ddb9d21d514c2afc134c6477e2d.mp4?t=1695033701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cultivate Your Bounty</h2>Onboard your trusty spaceship, transform your harvested resources into flourishing crops. Create the ultimate interstellar farm.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563140/extras/e3aaef629d309714fb21db4d49018b3a.poster.avif?t=1695033701\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563140/extras/e3aaef629d309714fb21db4d49018b3a.webm?t=1695033701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563140/extras/e3aaef629d309714fb21db4d49018b3a.mp4?t=1695033701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Warlock Life</h2>On your travels, find rare and powerful flora you can bring back to your den. These plants can then be utilised to give you powerful boons on your runs.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563140/extras/5de1f215c61efea055b2d039a076eb86.poster.avif?t=1695033701\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563140/extras/5de1f215c61efea055b2d039a076eb86.webm?t=1695033701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563140/extras/5de1f215c61efea055b2d039a076eb86.mp4?t=1695033701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Trade Among the Stars</h2>Encounter wandering traders during your galactic escapades and strike deals to sell your produce for credits. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563140/extras/a73b80e1584de78c5eb79bf9be5f551e.poster.avif?t=1695033701\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563140/extras/a73b80e1584de78c5eb79bf9be5f551e.webm?t=1695033701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563140/extras/a73b80e1584de78c5eb79bf9be5f551e.mp4?t=1695033701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Decorate Your Ship</h2>Find furniture on your expeditions and bring them back to spice up your farm.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563140/extras/c4d2a995242a8c05d2322a5262e152da.poster.avif?t=1695033701\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563140/extras/c4d2a995242a8c05d2322a5262e152da.webm?t=1695033701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563140/extras/c4d2a995242a8c05d2322a5262e152da.mp4?t=1695033701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade Your Cosmic Expedition</h2>Spend your hard-earned credits to enhance yourself and your spaceship.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563140/extras/62493a0364ce897dbbfa902f8bb163a2.poster.avif?t=1695033701\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563140/extras/62493a0364ce897dbbfa902f8bb163a2.webm?t=1695033701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563140/extras/62493a0364ce897dbbfa902f8bb163a2.mp4?t=1695033701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unravel the Secrets</h2>Immerse yourself in a story that unravels the mysteries of a long-dead planet. The fate of this forgotten world lies in your hands.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563140/extras/b98a0192f7b4aa26daf4f3737205c06d.poster.avif?t=1695033701\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563140/extras/b98a0192f7b4aa26daf4f3737205c06d.webm?t=1695033701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563140/extras/b98a0192f7b4aa26daf4f3737205c06d.mp4?t=1695033701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Auto-firing weapons<br></li><li>Fast runs (under 15 minutes)<br></li><li>Over 150 unique powers available to customise your runs<br></li><li>Find furniture and cuddly companions on your runs to take back to your ship<br></li><li>Expand your farm, recruit drones to aid you in the busy work, and use your profits to increase the power of your character<br></li><li>Each run takes you to many different planets, survive waves lasting 20-40 seconds and harvest as much as you can in that time</li></ul>",
